{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"halfling_archer","model_identifier":"halfling_archer","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# halfling_archer\n\nHalfling archer (A1), male body, 1.5 m = 53 u.\n\nHalfling male in a quilted mustard vest with a leather bracer, a halfling shortbow, a back quiver and a sheathed shortsword at the left hip as backup. Fights on foot and as the rear rider of the halfling war ox. Baseline skeleton and slot names; gear are preview groups inside the slots.\n\n- Cubes: 32 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -11.5..11.0, y 0.0..54.0, z -7.0..5.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 18 x 54 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `shoot` | 1.3 | once | key 0.82 s: arrow leaves the string (draw 0.3-0.7 s, short hold, loose) |\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | bow lowered in the left hand |\n| `walk` | 0.9 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.6 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on his back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `sit_ride` | 1 | loop | seated astride, bow lowered; gentle bob |\n| `ride_shoot` | 1.3 | once | key 0.82 s: arrow leaves the string, seated |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 37.3 u/s (1.05 m/s), cycle 0.9 s\n- `run`: 106.7 u/s (3.00 m/s), cycle 0.6 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `shoot`: key 0.82 s: arrow leaves the string (draw 0.3-0.7 s, short hold, loose)\n- `ride_shoot`: key 0.82 s: arrow leaves the string, seated\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 53, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 35, 6)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3, 39, 6)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (5, 44.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 33, -8)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (9, 25, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-12.5, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-9, 25, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (7.5, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-7.5, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `shortbow` (visible, under slot_hand_l): about 1.1 m (39 u), grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on the +Y side (faces the archer when drawn)\n- `quiver` (visible, under slot_quiver): hide case with fletched arrows\n- `shortsword` (visible, under slot_hip_l): sheathed shortsword, blade about 45 cm (16 u)\n\n## Notes\n\n- No arrow is modelled on the string; spawn the projectile at slot_hand_r / the bow at the key time (or attach the D2 arrow to slot_hand_r during the draw).\n- Riding: hips stay at their pivot (0, 21, 0); place that on the war ox `slot_rider_2`.\n"},"description":"# halfling_archer\n\nHalfling archer (A1), male body, 1.5 m = 53 u.\n\nHalfling male in a quilted mustard vest with a leather bracer, a halfling shortbow, a back quiver and a sheathed shortsword at the left hip as backup. Fights on foot and as the rear rider of the halfling war ox. Baseline skeleton and slot names; gear are preview groups inside the slots.\n\n- Cubes: 32 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -11.5..11.0, y 0.0..54.0, z -7.0..5.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 18 x 54 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `shoot` | 1.3 | once | key 0.82 s: arrow leaves the string (draw 0.3-0.7 s, short hold, loose) |\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | bow lowered in the left hand |\n| `walk` | 0.9 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.6 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on his back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `sit_ride` | 1 | loop | seated astride, bow lowered; gentle bob |\n| `ride_shoot` | 1.3 | once | key 0.82 s: arrow leaves the string, seated |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 37.3 u/s (1.05 m/s), cycle 0.9 s\n- `run`: 106.7 u/s (3.00 m/s), cycle 0.6 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `shoot`: key 0.82 s: arrow leaves the string (draw 0.3-0.7 s, short hold, loose)\n- `ride_shoot`: key 0.82 s: arrow leaves the string, seated\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 53, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 35, 6)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3, 39, 6)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (5, 44.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 33, -8)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (9, 25, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-12.5, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-9, 25, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (7.5, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-7.5, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `shortbow` (visible, under slot_hand_l): about 1.1 m (39 u), grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on the +Y side (faces the archer when drawn)\n- `quiver` (visible, under slot_quiver): hide case with fletched arrows\n- `shortsword` (visible, under slot_hip_l): sheathed shortsword, blade about 45 cm (16 u)\n\n## Notes\n\n- No arrow is modelled on the string; spawn the projectile at slot_hand_r / the bow at the key time (or attach the D2 arrow to slot_hand_r during the draw).\n- Riding: hips stay at their pivot (0, 21, 0); place that on the war ox `slot_rider_2`.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-6.5,21.0,-4.5],"to":[6.5,26.0,4.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,21.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[46,58,59.0,63.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[72,58,81.0,63.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[59,58,72.0,63.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[81,58,90.0,63.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":